<view class="page"><view class="title">站内通知</view><view class="muted">补位资格有确认期限，请及时刷新。本版本未接入微信订阅消息。</view><button bindtap="refresh" loading="{{busy}}">刷新通知</button><view class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id"><view>{{item.message}}</view><view class="muted">预约 #{{item.reservation_id}} · {{item.at}}</view><button wx:if="{{!item.read_at}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="read">标为已读</button><view wx:else>已读</view></view><view wx:if="{{!items.length}}">暂无通知</view><button wx:if="{{more}}" bindtap="next">加载更多</button></view>
